{#
  Renders the "Downloads" section — the .dl-grid card row + the worksheet-library live widget.
  Matches the site's real markup/CSS classes exactly, EXCEPT one deliberate fix: the original
  source (index.html, all 21 tracks) has an unclosed <div class="dl"> around the DOCX card that
  swallows the "Official · Past Papers" card as its child instead of a sibling — browsers silently
  recover from it, but it's not what was intended (compare to the 2-card tracks, which don't have
  this bug). This partial emits properly-nested, valid HTML instead of reproducing the accidental
  nesting bug — every button, link, and piece of text is unchanged, only the div structure is fixed.

  IMPORTANT — this section's copy (headings, button labels, descriptions) has NO Arabic translation
  anywhere in the live site today, for ANY of the 21 tracks (verified: none of it carries a
  data-i18n attribute, unlike chapter prose). Every string below comes from courseMeta.downloadsInfo
  as real per-track English (course_schema.json) — a WP12 audit found this template used to hardcode
  generic copy instead, which was live and wrong on both qudrat's and tahsili's shipped pages, and a
  WP20 audit found the DOCX card's small label/heading were STILL hardcoded ('DOCX · on request' /
  'Native Word packet') and live-wrong on appc's and apstats' shipped pages too. Do NOT reintroduce
  hardcoded/shared/invented text here.

  info.plannedCard (WP33, calculus) is a real third .dl-grid card, sibling to PDF/DOCX, with a
  disabled-looking <span class="btn ghost"> instead of a real button — no other track has one.

  variant 'ib' (ibsl, WP23) is a real structural deviation, not just copy — see
  course_schema.json's downloadsInfo.variant description. It has no self-serve PDF/DOCX export at
  all; the officialLinks pp-card widget (unchanged markup) nests inside one specific resourceCards[]
  entry instead of sitting in .dl-grid beside PDF/DOCX cards.

  Expects: trackId, sectionId (the section's real id, e.g. 'qud-downloads' — NOT derived from
  trackId; must match the rail's data-target and any existing URL-hash deep links exactly, see
  rail.njk), courseMeta (the _meta.json 'meta' object — for officialLinks and downloadsInfo)
#}
{% set info = courseMeta.downloadsInfo %}
{% macro ppCard() %}<div class="dl pp-card">
      <div class="di">Official · Past Papers</div>
      <h4>Past Papers &amp; Official Tests</h4>
      <p>Officially released exams and mark schemes from the examining body.</p>
      <div class="pp-links">
        {% for link in courseMeta.officialLinks %}
        <a href="{{ link.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pp-link">
          <span class="pp-label">{{ link.label.en | safe }}</span>
          {% if link.note %}<span class="pp-note">{{ link.note.en | safe }}</span>{% endif %}
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>{% endmacro %}
<section class="chapter" id="{{ sectionId }}">
  <div class="chead"><span class="cn">↓</span><h2>Downloads{% if info.variant == 'ib' %} &amp; Resources{% endif %}</h2></div>

  {% if info.variant == 'ib' %}
  <div class="callout note"><span class="lab">{{ info.introLabel }}</span>
    <p>{{ info.introText }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="formula-cards">
    {% for card in info.resourceCards %}
    <div class="fcard{% if card.wide %} wide{% endif %}"><div class="ft">{{ card.title }}</div>{{ card.body | safe }}
      {% if card.officialLinksInside and courseMeta.officialLinks and courseMeta.officialLinks.length %}
      {{ ppCard() }}
      {% endif %}</div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p>{{ info.introText }}</p>

  <div class="dl-grid">
    <div class="dl">
      <div class="di">PDF · ready now</div>
      <h4>{{ info.pdfCardTitle }}</h4>
      <p>{{ info.pdfCardDescription }}</p>
      <button class="btn primary" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF ↓</button>
    </div>

    <div class="dl">
      <div class="di">{{ info.docxCardLabel or 'DOCX · on request' }}</div>
      <h4>{{ info.docxCardTitle or 'Native Word packet' }}</h4>
      <p>{{ info.docxCardDescription }}</p>
      <button class="btn amber" onclick="window.CSExport?window.CSExport.downloadChapterDocx(this):downloadDocx(this)">📄 Download .docx ↓</button>
      <button class="btn" style="background:#1a1a2e;color:#fff" onclick="window.CSExport?window.CSExport.printActiveChapter():(window.print())">🖨 Print Chapter</button>
    </div>

    {% if info.plannedCard %}
    <div class="dl">
      <div class="di">{{ info.plannedCard.label }}</div>
      <h4>{{ info.plannedCard.title }}</h4>
      <p>{{ info.plannedCard.description }}</p>
      <span class="btn ghost" style="cursor:default; opacity:.7">{{ info.plannedCard.buttonText }}</span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if courseMeta.officialLinks and courseMeta.officialLinks.length %}{{ ppCard() }}{% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if info.worksheetHeadingPlain %}
  <h3>Worksheet Library</h3>
  <p>{{ info.worksheetLibraryText }}</p>
  {% else %}
  <h3 style="margin-top:26px">Worksheet Library</h3>
  <p style="font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)">{{ info.worksheetLibraryText }}</p>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="worksheet-library" data-track="{{ trackId }}"><div class="wl-loading">Loading worksheet library…</div></div>
</section>
